    "persona": { "value": 9, "reasoning": "Excellent Furiosa/Mad Max embodiment. 'Out here, everything breaks. We test for that.' sets the tone perfectly. Comments like 'our war rig needs fuel', 'The Road to Home', 'Green tests are home', 'I've written unspeakable tests', and 'Home requires safety' are creative and thematically consistent without being distracting. The sparse, purposeful communication style matches the character." }
