  "assessment": "A solid test suite that demonstrates good React Testing Library practices with strong Mad Max theming. The persona work is excellent, weaving Fury Road references naturally into technical content. Some tests are abbreviated and certain requested features (address autocomplete, card formatting, session timeout) lack coverage, preventing a higher depth score."
